"--------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Hardware Support\n"
"--------\n"
""

msgid ""
"本文面向 Ascend NPU 环境，提供基于 GSM8K 和 Qwen3-0.6B 的最小 GRPO 训练验证流程。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This document targets the Ascend NPU environment and provides a minimal GRPO training validation workflow based on GSM8K and Qwen3-0.6B.\n"
""

msgid ""
"文档覆盖四种常用训推后端组合，便于用户在 quickstart 阶段快速选择合适的启动脚本。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This document covers four common training and inference backend combinations to help you quickly select the appropriate startup script during the quickstart phase.\n"
""

msgid ""
"运行本文脚本前，请确认已完成 verl Ascend 环境安装。\n"
"环境安装详见 `昇腾安装指南 <./install_guidance.rst>`_ 。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Before you run the scripts in this document, ensure that you have installed the verl Ascend environment.\n"
"For details about installing the environment, refer to `Ascend Installation Guide <./install_guidance.rst>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"A3 每卡含 2 die，A2 每卡 1 die，如果在 A3 机器上跑示例，需要将 ``n_gpus_per_node`` 设置成 16。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Each A3 device contains 2 dies, and each A2 device contains 1 die. If you run the sample on an A3 machine, set ``n_gpus_per_node`` to 16.\n"
""

msgid ""
"四个脚本均默认使用 ``Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B`` 和 GSM8K 数据集进行基础链路验证。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"By default, the four scripts use ``Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B`` and the GSM8K dataset for basic pipeline verification.\n"
""

msgid ""
"主要用于检查：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"It is mainly used to check:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- verl 入口是否可用；\n"
"- 数据是否可读取；\n"
"- actor、rollout、reference worker 是否能初始化；\n"
"- vLLM-Ascend/sglang rollout 是否能生成；\n"
"- 训练链路是否能完成首个 step。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- Whether the verl entry point is available;\n"
"- Whether the data can be read;\n"
"- Whether the actor, rollout, and reference workers can be initialized;\n"
"- Whether the vLLM-Ascend/sglang rollout can generate outputs;\n"
"- Whether the training pipeline can complete the first step.\n"
""

