msgid ""
"Quick Start 当前提供四种常用训推后端组合。用户可根据训练后端和 rollout 后端选择对应脚本\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Quick Start provides four common training and rollout backend combinations. You can select the corresponding script based on the training backend and the rollout backend.\n"
""

